label mha_intro:
    scene black
    with fade
    play sound "wind_low.wav"
    thought "..Cold."
    thought "Not the cold of night training."
    thought "This is different."
    pause 0.5
    play sound "heartbeat.wav"
    thought "...My body hurts."
    scene bg street
    with fade
    play sound "city_ambience.wav"
    show screen shake
    pause 0.5
    thought "-!"
    p "..Gh-"
    show mui at center
    mui "...Tch."
    mui "So you're alive."
    pause 0.3
    p "...Where.."
    p "Where is this?"
    thought "The sky is too bright."
    thought "The air.. smells wrong."
    mui "I don't know."
    pause 0.3
    thought "That answer shouldn't scare me."
    thought "But it does."
    scene bg street
    show aizawa at center
    aizawa "..You two are finally awake."
    p "..Who-"
    mui "..Not a demon."
    thought "Buildings... too tall."
    thought "Just steel and glass."
    p "This isn't the South district."
    mui "No."
    mui "It's not anywhere I know."
    pause 0.4
    p "Muichiro.. look around."
    mui "I am."
    mui "It's unecessary noise everywhere."
    thought "He's calm."
    thought "Too calm."
    p "You're not even surprised?"
    mui "Surprise doesn't change anything."
    pause 0.3
    p "That's not true."
    p "You used to say surprise meant you were still human."
    mui "..."
    mui "I don't remember saying that."
    thought "There is it again."

    aizawa "Aizawa. Pro Hero."
    aizawa "You collapsed in the middle of the street."
    p "Hero..?"
    mui "That word doesn't exist where we're from."
    aizawa "That's becoming obvious."
    p "We were fighting a demon."
    aizawa "...That again."
    mui "Upper Rank."
    mui "I am a Hashira."
    pause
    aizawa "Either this is the worst coordinated lie I've head.."
    aizawa "Or reality itself is malfunctioning."

    scene black
    thought "We used to train under the same sky."
    thought "Same ground."
    thought "Same silence."
    thought "This.. isn't that sky."
    scene bg street
    show mui at center
    p "Do you recognize anything?"
    mui "No."
    pause
    mui "But it feels.. wrong."
    thought "I don't like the sound of that."

    P "You used to say every place had a 'breathing rhytm'."
    mui "..Did I?"
    p "Yes."
    p "You said you could hear it when you stopped talking."
    mui "..."
    mui "This place doesn't have one."
    pause long
    aizawa "You don’t have anywhere to go."
    p "No."
    mui "No."
    aizawa "Then you’re coming with me."
    mui "We don’t trust strangers."
    aizawa "Then don’t."
    aizawa "But you won’t survive here alone."
    pause
    mui "…Tch."
    p "We’ll go."
    scene bg ua_gate
    with fade
    play sound "distant_city.wav"
    thought "Everything feels too alive."
    thought "And somehow… empty."
    mui "…So this is the new world."
    p "Yeah."
    p "And we’re stuck in it."
    scene black with fade
    scene bg office
    with fade
    show nezu at center
    nezu "Interesting."
    nezu "A fractured connection across worlds.. fascinating!"
    p "Don't analyze it like that."
    mui "I always liked animals."
    p "You called them 'walking mysteries' when we were kids."
    mui "..That's accurate."
    nezu "Oh my!"

    scene bg classroom
    with fade
    show aizawa at center
    aizawa "Two transfer students."
    p "My name is [player_name]."
    mina "Are you two like… cosplayers?"
    denki "That sword is REAL?!"
    mui "It is."
    pause 0.3
    